@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> NotCreated
NotCreated --> SetupPending : create vault
SetupPending --> Locked : master password + key registered
SetupPending --> NotCreated : cancel / setup error
Locked --> Authenticating : unlock request
Authenticating --> Unlocked : [master password valid\nand registered FIDO2 key valid]
Authenticating --> Locked : [invalid factor / cancel / error]
Unlocked --> Locking : user lock / Windows session lock or exit
Locking --> Locked : hide secrets, revoke UI access, clear clipboard if supported
Locked --> [*] : application exit
@enduml
